    "preamble": "Sheril J vs State Of Kerala on 8 January, 2026 Author: P. V. Kunhikrishnan Bench: P.V.Kunhikrishnan 2026:Ker:1087 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice P.V.Kunhikrishnan Thursday, The 8Th Day Of January 2026 / 18Th Pousha, 1947 Wp(C) No. 464 Of 2026 Petitioner: 1 Sheril J Aged 50 Years Proprietor Of Vaniyapurakkal Hotel, Son Of Jacob V John, Vaniyapurakkal House, Azhiyidathuchira P.O, Thiruvalla, Pathanamthitta District, Pin - 689113 By Adv Sri.C.C.Anoop Respondents: 1 State Of Kerala Represented By The Secretary To Government, Local Self Government Department, Secretariat, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695001 2 Ranni Perunadu Grama Panchayath Represented By Its Secretary, Perunadu P.O., Pathanamthitta District, Pin - 689711 3 The Secretary Ranni Perunadu Grama Panchayath, Perunadu P.O., Pathanamthitta District, Pin - 689711 Smt Chithra Chandrasekharan, Sc Sheril J vs State Of Kerala on 8 January, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/127405824/ 1 This Writ Petition (Civil) Having Come Up For Admission On 08.01.2026, The Court On The Same Day Delivered The Following: W.P.(C.) No.464 of 2026 -2- 2026:Ker:1087 P. V. Kunhikrishnan, J ------------------------------------ W.P.(C.) No.464 of 2026 ------------------------------------ Dated, this the 08th day of January, 2026 Judgment",
